6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,800
C a t

7
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,950
C a t cat!

8
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,860
Cat! cat!

9
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:21,300
