10
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,800
D o g

11
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,950
D o g dog!

12
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:27,860
Dog! dog!

13
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:31,300
