55
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:30,800
Un un un un!

56
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:37,860
Which word says dog?

57
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,950
Yes! It's dog!

58
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:43,950
